{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-16-1","title":"Acts 16:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Paul having circumcised Timothy, 7 and being called by the Spirit from one country to another, 14 converts Lydia, 16 and casts out a spirit of divination; 19 for which cause he and Silas are whipped and imprisoned. 25 The prison doors are opened. 31 The jailor is converted, 35 and they are delivered.</p>\n<p>to Derbe. 14:6,21; 2Ti 3:11 named. 17:14; 18:5; 19:22; 20:4,5; Ro 16:21; 1Co 4:17; Php 1:1; 2:19; Col 1:1 1Th 1:1; 3:2; 2Th 1:1; 1Ti 1:2; 2Ti 1:2; Heb 13:23 which. 2Ti 1:5; 3:15,16 but. 14:1; Ezr 9:2; 1Co 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-16-2","title":"Acts 16:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>was. 6:3; 1Ti 3:7; 5:10,25; 2Ti 3:15; Heb 11:2 Iconium. 14:21; 2Ti 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-16-3","title":"Acts 16:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>would. 15:37,40 and took. 15:20; 1Co 7:19; 9:20; Ga 2:3,8; 5:1-3,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-16-4","title":"Acts 16:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>they delivered. 15:6,28,29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-16-5","title":"Acts 16:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>so. 15:41; 2Ch 20:20; Isa 7:9; Ro 16:25; 1Co 15:58; Ga 5:1; Eph 4:13-16 Col 2:6; 1Th 3:2,13; 2Th 2:16; Heb 13:9,20,21; 1Pe 5:10 increased. 2:47; 4:4; 5:14; 6:7; 9:31; 11:21; 12:24; 13:48,49; 19:18-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-16-6","title":"Acts 16:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Phrygia.